  "content": [
    {
      "text": "God came to Abimelech in a dream, Gen. 20:3. he dreamed, and behold a ladder … reached to heaven, Gen. 28:12. God came to Laban the Syrian in a dream, Gen. 31:24. Joseph dreamed a dream, Gen. 37:5. this dreamer cometh, Gen. 37:19. We have dreamed a dream, and there is no interpreter, Gen. 40:8. Pharaoh dreamed … he stood by the river, Gen. 41:1. Joseph remembered the dreams which he dreamed, Gen. 42:9. Lord … will speak unto him in a dream, Num. 12:6. If there arise … a dreamer of dreams, Deut. 13:1. man that told a dream unto his fellow, Judg. 7:13. Lord answered him not, neither by dreams, 1 Sam. 28:6. Lord appeared to Solomon in a dream, 1 Kgs. 3:5. against them that prophesy false dreams, Jer. 23:32. neither hearken to your dreams, Jer. 29:8. Nebuchadnezzar dreamed dreams, Dan. 2:1. Thy dream … are these, Dan. 2:28. Daniel had a dream, Dan. 7:1. old men shall dream dreams, Joel 2:28 (Acts 2:17). diviners … have told false dreams, Zech. 10:2.",
